{"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"TokensProvider Implementations"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"]]},"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider\/tokensprovider-implementations"]}],"references":{"ic_theme_orange.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"image","alt":null},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"Theme Orange"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"component tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for list item components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSmallListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ListItemComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), opacities (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and dimensions (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"title":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider/checkInstances(count:for:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkInstances","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"checkInstances(count:for:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider\/checkinstances(count:for:)"}}}